& [ConstraintClassification] is explicit
  + [hard] must hold for canonical purpose authority
  + [profile] must be satisfied by each future language or target profile
  + [implementation] must be proved by a separately authorized implementation
  + [runtime] must be revalidated for every admitted run
  + [experimental] may be investigated without being treated as established capability

& [ConstraintSet] is checked
  + [C01_source_preservation] hard: raw source digest and bytes remain exact
